OL,3,GNEWSAGirl's family sues police over
OL,4,Aempty van crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 12-year-old girl who
OL,7,Fwas seriously injured when she was hit
OL,8,Fby an unoccupied police van is suing
OL,9,Fthe force.
OL,11,FOn 18 April an empty Cumbria Police
OL,12,Fvan, which had its handbrake off,
OL,13,Frolled into two 12-year-old girls on
OL,14,FSenhouse Street in Maryport.
OL,16,FOne of the girls, Pheobe Rogerson, was
OL,17,Fcrushed against a wall and spent 11
OL,18,Fdays in hospital after blood and air
OL,19,Fcollected in the chest cavity around
OL,20,Fher heart, according to her lawyers.
OL,21,FThe girl's mother Fallon Gartland said:
OL,22,F"I thought she was going to die."
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
